Follow `docs/EDITORIAL.md` and `docs/EVIDENCE.md`. Research workflow: `docs/RESEARCH-WORKFLOW.md`.

- Reject generic AI food writing. Teach mechanism, observation, variables, and failure modes.
- Observe, don't just time.
- Never improvise food-safety numbers.
- Never set `status: reviewed`.
- Prefer deepening a canonical ID over creating a duplicate page.
